think Designed the read in two registers mirroring click_between's two-register shape: EXACT center-collinearity (the cross product of the three group-frame centers, doubled so the midpoint is an exact integer, no float, no tolerance -- REDS discipline) and AXIS-BAND alignment (do the three frames share a row or column band, a layout surface's same-row/same-column snap). classify_collinear names both/exact_only/band_only/neither.
think The decisive crux keeps the family's box-is-a-prefilter theme and lifts it to a TRIPLE split by DIMENSION: the band a 1-D projection-overlap fact, collinearity a 2-D area fact (the cross product IS twice the signed triangle area, zero iff degenerate). One 16x12 scene of six singletons yields all four verdicts by choosing triples: P,Q,R both; P,D,E exact_only (a diagonal the band snap misses); P,Q,F band_only (a band over-claiming a line); P,D,R neither. Both relations symmetric in the unordered triple.
